    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i tried tightening a bolt to see if it helped but the noise is still there. it almost feels like something is actively messing with the timing or the way the parts are sitting. is it common for these mechanical issues to just happen out of nowhere like that?",
